        <BooleanAttribute Name="SetPoint" SystemDefined="true">false</BooleanAttribute>
      </AttributeList>
      <Comment>
        <MultiLanguageText Lang="en-US">Out: asserted through PreStart (Step 10) only - one fresh, operator-commanded start attempt arms the motor once. FC_ControlMain ORs it into the imported motor FB's RecentStart, which that FB self-clears once running or faulted (its own press-to-arm contract), so no restart happens without a new cycle start (REQ-062).</MultiLanguageText>
