        <MultiLanguageText Lang="en-US">Out: pre-start park request to the pusher - held through the machine-start steps 20-40 (range intent per C-603: any step inserted inside the start ramp still wants the pusher home) so the pusher reparks-with-warning if off home once the siren phase completes (REQ-045).</MultiLanguageText>
